immediate-early / stress (defines Stro-9)
  nuclei positive for >=1 of the panel: 39.60%
  FOSB=1.096%, JUND=33.831%, ATF3=2.308%, NR4A1=3.497%, IER2=6.951%, SOCS3=4.340%

C7 program (defines Stro-7)
